e leading health care services companies in the United States. At December 31, 2025, we operated 190 hospitals, comprised of 179 general acute care hospitals, seven behavioral hospitals, and four rehabilitation hospitals. In addition, we operated 121 freestanding ambulatory surgery centers (\u201cASCs\u201d) and 31 freestanding endoscopy centers. Our facilities are located in 19 states and England. The terms \u201cCompany,\u201d \u201cHCA,\u201d \u201cHCA Healthcare,\u201d \u201cwe,\u201d \u201cour\u201d or \u201cus,\u201d as used herein and unless otherwise stated or indicated by context, refer to HCA Healthcare, Inc. and its affiliates. The term \u201caffiliates\u201d means direct and indirect subsidiaries of HCA Healthcare, Inc. and partnerships and joint ventures in which such subsidiaries are partners.","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/860730/000119312526044769/hca-20251231.htm","filed":"2026-02-10","source":"10-K"},"periods":{"q":["2010-03-31","2010-06-30","2010-09-30","2010-12-31","2011-03-31","2011-06-30","2011-09-30","2011-12-31","2012-03-31","2012-06-30","2012-09-30","2012-12-31","2013-03-31","2013-06-30","2013-09-30","2013-12-31","2014-03-31","2014-06-30","2014-09-30","2014-12-31","2015-03-31","2015-06-30","2017-03-31","2017-06-30","2017-09-30","2017-12-31","2018-03-31","2018-06-30","2018-09-30","2018-12-31","2019-03-31","2019-06-30","2019-09-30","2019-12-31","2020-03-31","2020-06-30","2020-09-30","2020-12-31","2021-03-31","2021-06-30","2021-09-30","2021-12-31","2022-03-31","2022-06-30","2022-09-30","2022-12-31","2023-03-31","2023-06-30","2023-09-30","2023-12-31","2024-03-31","2024-06-30","2024-09-30","2024-12-31","2025-03-31","2025-06-30","2025-09-30","2025-12-31","2026-03-31"],"fy":["2009-12-31","2010-12-31","2011-12-31","2012-12-31","2013-12-31","2014-12-31","2016-12-31","2017-12-31","2018-12-31","2019-12-31","2020-12-31","2021-12-31","2022-12-31","2023-12-31","2024-12-31","2025-12-31"]},"da_v":2,"years":{"2024-12-31":{"end":"2024-12-31",